.TH ORO-INTERNAL-DIRECT-SOCKETS-POLICY 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:internal/direct\-sockets\-policy \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:internal/direct\-sockets\-policy'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:internal/direct\-sockets\-policy is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBisDirectSocketsAllowed()\fR
Direct Sockets Permissions\-Policy gating.
.br
This runtime does not consume HTTP Permissions\-Policy headers directly, but apps may configure an opt\-in/opt\-out toggle using either: \- __args.config.permissions_policy_direct_sockets (boolean) \- __args.env.DIRECT_SOCKETS_ALLOWED ("1" | "true" | "yes" | "0" | "false" | "no")
.br
Default behavior: allowed.
